  "body_html": "<h1>Core Payoffs Are Imputations</h1>\n<p>Every payoff vector in the core is an imputation.</p>\n<p>Indeed, the core definition already contains efficiency:\n$$\n  \\sum_{i \\in N} x_i = v(N).\n$$\nFor individual rationality, apply the core's coalitional rationality\ncondition to the singleton coalition $\\{i\\}$:\n$$\n  x_i = \\sum_{j \\in \\{i\\}} x_j \\ge v(\\{i\\}).\n$$</p>\n<p>Thus core membership implies both efficiency and individual rationality.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[MSZ Ch.17, Def 17.1-17.2] Maschler, Solan, Zamir, <em>Game Theory</em>.</li>\n</ul>",
